{"name":"-48-3-14","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"408","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"GF_21summer_avg_Reunion","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Thunder_Dry","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"When the battle is over, there is also no sign of the storm anymore."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"HK416Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"416","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The cargo is here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP9Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP9","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Schön！"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Just then, SOP-II looks outside the warehouse and lets out a joyous yelp."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M16... M4?!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A familiar figure slowly strolls up to the group with strong lights shining from behind."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"With M4 hanging on one arm, she tosses the other escapee onto the ground."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"UMP45Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"UMP4