did she abandon M4? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...But from the moment she rescued M4, 15 no longer has the right to begrudge her for that."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...You asshole."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She tightens her grip on M4 and shoots daggers at M16."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"RO635 is also staring at M16. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Like ST AR-15, she is struggling to rein in her raging emotions. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"M16 is back. Her return makes RO feel confused, puzzled, suspicious, doubtful. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But all these emotions are overshadowed by joy. She must admit... She is incredibly glad to see M16 again, and she welcomes her wholeheartedly."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Welcome back."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thanks."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Returning the Commander's ambivalent gaze, M16 just smiles faintly. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The smile takes the Commander right back to the original Griffin base two years ago."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Only when M16's smile turns into a grimace does the Commander return to the present. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Her white hair suddenly looks very strange and jarring."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What on earth... Happened to you afterwards?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Forget it... It's not worth mentioning."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Surrounded by the AR Team, M16 walks up to the Commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She looks at the Commander and puts a hand on their shoulder."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thank you for everything."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander takes a deep breath."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Welcome home."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M16 chuckles awkwardly at the Commander's open arms, but still goes in for a hug obligingly. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She lets go after a brief moment."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"To be honest... I'm really not used to this."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4 SOPMOD IIMod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M16! I want a hug too!!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Uh... Hold on, you're heav..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Sobs)"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"RO635 can't hold herself back any longer and also wraps her arms tightly around M16 as well."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Watching her two friends, ST AR-15 takes a deep breath, as if to steel herself for some kind of embarrassment."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What... Not you too? You're not the type for this kind of thing... No, wait! This is getting too heavy!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AR15Mod","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"ST AR-15","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't care. You deserve it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M16A1BOSS","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M16A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Wait... Tsk!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Watching the AR Team all squeezed in a tight embrace, the Commander lets out an amused chuckle. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...There are still a lot of questions they want to ask, but right now, for both the Comm